			tasks: [{ id: "5433573383B4D510", item: "gtceu:data_bank", type: "item" }]
			title: "Data Bank"
			x: 17.5d
			y: -7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B2010A931E1A4D8"]
			description: ["The &6High-Performance Computation Array&r is a stack of computation racks that the research station draws on. Heat sinks and active coolers, optical pipe from the microgravity smelter, and more racks the more you ask of it. Computation power for every orb the station writes. Power and coolant are the whole upkeep; keep them on the network."]
			icon: "gtceu:high_performance_computation_array"
			id: "13A62146F4473640"
			rewards: [{ id: "714FA3D37CB79A98", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "52BED25C75EA3BE1", item: "gtceu:high_performance_computation_array", type: "item" }]
			title: "Computation Array"
			x: 19.0d
			y: -7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["13A62146F4473640"]
			description: ["The &6Research Station&r reads a data stick or orb, runs the array on it and writes the research back. The array behind it, the data bank for storage, and a research item to read. The first ZPM research: the hatch that opens the next era. Feed orbs by ME and let the bank file them."]
			icon: "gtceu:research_station"
			id: "113C8087627608BC"
			rewards: [{ id: "117718B1897E66DE", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "1DE08E8A54C44936", item: "gtceu:research_station", type: "item" }]
			title: "Research Station"
			x: 20.5d
			y: -8.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["113C8087627608BC"]
			description: ["A blank orb written with the ZPM energy hatch's research is the first one worth keeping. The large mixer on two LuV hatches for the wiring, and the europium that went into the station's ZPM motors. The ZPM energy hatch, and so the gate to the next era. Copy orbs rather than rewriting them; the station keeps the original."]
			icon: "gtceu:data_orb"
			id: "32CEA916CCFD8B21"
			rewards: [
				{ id: "1542FA63425C2185", type: "xp", xp: 150 }
